# Build output only. Everything a figure depends on stays in the tree.
#
# Anchored and specific, never a bare directory name: the rust slice's published encode
# column had to be WITHDRAWN because a `[Bb]in/` rule meant for .NET output swallowed its
# measurement binaries (its D19), and `ffi/.gitignore` re-includes `logs/**` and
# `poc/**/gen/` for the same reason. `gen/audit_tracked.sh` in the cpp slice checks this
# from git's own answer rather than by reading this file.
/target/
gen/__pycache__/
*.pyc
